 "result": "Created `src/routes/v2/upload.ts` (57 lines). I haven't compiled or tested it.\n\n- **Storage:** files are written to local disk in `scratch/`. `UPLOAD_DIR` can override the directory. There is no cloud storage.\n- **Quota:** the handler adds up the sizes of the files already in the directory. It returns 413 if the new file would push the total over `UPLOAD_QUOTA_BYTES`. I picked a 100 MB default, so change it if you want a different limit.\n- **Filenames:** names go through `basename()` to block path traversal.\n- **Caveats:** the quota check isn't atomic, so two simultaneous uploads could together exceed the limit. It also doesn't count subdirectories.\n- **Types and exports:** there is no `any`, and all exports are named.",
